# targetuserspacecreator — Behavior Inventory & Refactor Baseline

## Context

We plan to refactor the `targetuserspacecreator` actor. Its logic module
(`libraries/userspacegen.py`, ~1443 lines) carries a standing developer TODO
(Issue #486, lines 45–67) stating the module does five distinct jobs, parses
repofiles redundantly, and needs significant restructuring. Before touching it,
we need a complete, code-derived contract of *everything the actor does* so we
can verify after the refactor that no required behavior was lost.

Stated intent: **the only external (outside-world) change is dropping deprecated
functionality, eventually replaced by a conceptual solution.** One finding below
challenges how "internal" that really is (see §D).

All items below are read directly from the source [High certainty] unless marked.

Files:
- `repos/system_upgrade/common/actors/targetuserspacecreator/actor.py` — thin entrypoint
- `.../libraries/userspacegen.py` — essentially all logic
- `.../libraries/constants.py` — scratch/mount/userspace paths
- `.../tests/unit_test_targetuserspacecreator.py` — unit tests

---

## A. High-level purpose

Build the **target userspace**: a minimal install of the *target* OS RPM stack
(dnf, rpm, util-linux, …) laid into `/var/lib/leapp/el{TARGET_MAJOR}userspace`,
so leapp can enter it as a container (nspawn/chroot) and run target binaries
(the real DNF upgrade transaction, dracut initramfs build). Bootstrapped inside a
writable **source overlay** (overlayfs over the running system) entered via
nspawn, then decoupled into its own directory.

Runs in **TargetTransactionFactsCollectionPhase** (tags `IPUWorkflowTag,
TargetTransactionFactsPhaseTag`). Effective order in phase: `createisorepofile`
(produces `CustomTargetRepositoryFile`) → **this actor** →
`convert/swapdistropackagesworkaround` (consumes our output).

---

## B. Messages (the interface contract)

**Consumes:** `CustomTargetRepositoryFile`, `LiveModeConfig` (declared, unused
here), `RHSMInfo`, `RHUIInfo`, `RepositoriesFacts` (error-hint path only),
`RepositoriesMapping` (gate: must be non-empty to run), `RequiredTargetUserspacePackages`
(**deprecated**), `StorageInfo` (required), `TargetOSInstallationImage` (optional
ISO), `TargetRepositories`, `TargetUserSpacePreupgradeTasks`, `XFSPresence`,
`PkgManagerInfo` (error-hint path only).

**Produces:** `TargetUserSpaceInfo` (main output: path/scratch/mounts),
`UsedTargetRepositories` (repoids actually used), `Report` (inhibitors/warnings),
`TMPTargetRepositoriesFacts` (**deprecated**).

Downstream consumers of our output (blast radius of any interface change):
- `TargetUserSpaceInfo` → 15+ actors incl. all dnf* transaction/download actors,
  initramfs generators, `adjustlocalrepos`, livemode, convert workaround.
- `UsedTargetRepositories` → 9 actors incl. dnf* actors, `enablerhsmtargetrepos`,
  `missinggpgkeysinhibitor`, `adjustlocalrepos`.
- `TMPTargetRepositoriesFacts` → **only** `adjustlocalrepos`, `missinggpgkeysinhibitor`.

