## C. Behavior inventory (use-case checklist)

### Entry gating
1. Runs only if `(LEAPP_DEVEL_SKIP_CHECK_OS_RELEASE set OR is_supported_version())`
   AND a `RepositoriesMapping` message exists (`actor.py:57-60`).

### Input aggregation (`_InputData`)
2. Default packages: `dnf`, `dnf-command(config-manager)`, `dnf-command(download)`,
   `util-linux`.
3. Adds `install_rpms` + `copy_files` from `TargetUserSpacePreupgradeTasks`
   (dedupes CopyFiles by (src,dst)).
4. Adds packages from **deprecated** `RequiredTargetUserspacePackages`.
5. Collects `RHSMInfo`, `RHUIInfo`, `XFSPresence`, `StorageInfo`, custom repofiles.
6. Error: no RHSMInfo & not skip_rhsm → StopActorExecution ("Is this system registered?").
7. Error: skip_rhsm but RHSMInfo present → StopActorExecutionError (inconsistent).
8. Error: no StorageInfo → StopActorExecutionError.

### Overlay / container orchestration (`perform`)
9. Compute reserved free space via `overlaygen.get_recommended_leapp_free_space`.
10. Create source overlay (`create_source_overlay`, passes storage_info, xfs_info,
    scratch_reserve) → nspawn scratch container.
11. Mount target ISO into container root if `TargetOSInstallationImage` present.

### Repository setup
12. RHUI (cloud) setup if `RHUIInfo` present — full client swap in scratch
    container via `dnf shell` (remove source clients, install target clients);
    pre/post-install task application; `bootstrap_target_client` toggle (skip
    install, rely on bundled files); `enable_only_repoids_in_copied_files` toggle;
    foreign-repofile renaming to isolate `dnf repolist`; cleanup of injected/
    unowned repofiles.
13. RHSM: `set_container_mode`, `switch_certificate` (install chosen product cert).
14. CentOS Stream: `adjust_dnf_stream_variable` writes `{major}-stream` to dnf
    `$stream` var (only when target distro == centos).
15. Install custom repofiles into container (`_install_custom_repofiles`).
16. Gather usable target repos (`gather_target_repositories`): match distro repos
    against discovered repoids + custom repos against all repoids.
17. Distro repoid discovery (`_get_distro_available_repoids`) + RHUI repoid
    discovery. Base-repo (baseos+appstream) presence check — **skipped** for
    conversions, CS8→CS9, and non-rhel-without-rhsm.

### Userspace build (`_create_target_userspace`)
18. `prepare_target_userspace`: wipe+recreate userspace dir; bind-mount into
    container; import target GPG keys (unless nogpgcheck); run
    `dnf install` into `--installroot` with target releasever, module_platform_id,
    disable-all/enable-selected repos, `--disableplugin subscription-manager` if
    skip_rhsm, `--nogpgcheck` if set.
19. `_prep_repository_access`: copy certificates (decoupling symlinks, preserving
    RPM-owned files under /etc/pki), `update-ca-trust` via chroot, copy /etc/rhsm
    (unless skip_rhsm), shuffle /etc/yum.repos.d preserving RPM-owned repo files.
20. Copy `copy_files` into userspace.
21. Install leapp DNF plugin (`dnfplugin.install`).
22. RHUI: remove injected repofiles not owned by RPMs (when not bootstrap_target_client).
23. Re-enter userspace via nspawn, set RHSM container mode.

### Output production
24. Parse target container repofiles → produce **deprecated** `TMPTargetRepositoriesFacts`.
25. Produce `UsedTargetRepositories`.
26. Produce `TargetUserSpaceInfo`.

### Cross-cutting behaviors
27. Cert/symlink decoupling engine (`_copy_decouple`, `_choose_copy_or_link`,
    `_copy_symlinks`, `_copy_certificates`): copy links pointing outside srcdir as
    real files, preserve links inside; skip broken/circular symlinks; RPM-owned
    files always win. (Most heavily unit-tested behavior, ~55 cases.)
28. RPM-ownership queries (`_get_files_owned_by_rpms`, recursive with
    `/directory-hash` skip for EL9+ ca-certificates performance).
29. Dev persistent package cache (`LEAPP_DEVEL_USE_PERSISTENT_PACKAGE_CACHE`):
    move cache in/out of userspace `var/cache/dnf`.
30. Disk-space handling: proactive reserve (see #9); reactive parse of dnf
    "more space needed" → friendly error + dedicated-partition KB link.
31. Product certificate selection by arch (x86_64/aarch64/ppc64le/s390x) ×
    product type (ga/beta); rhel-only, else None; missing cert → inhibitor.
32. GPG check toggle (`LEAPP_NOGPGCHECK` / `is_nogpgcheck_set`).
33. Proxy detection on dnf failure → proxy-specific hint (leapp unsupported
    behind proxy).
34. CentOS→RHEL conversion hint on dnf failure ("target may not be released, use
    --target-version").

### Inhibitors / reports (must survive refactor)
- Missing product certificate (HIGH, INHIBITOR).
- Duplicate repositories (MEDIUM, INHIBITOR) — only when skip_rhsm.
- Missing base repos baseos/appstream (HIGH, INHIBITOR).
- No enabled target repositories (HIGH, INHIBITOR).
- Missing custom target repositories (HIGH, INHIBITOR).

### Env vars read
`LEAPP_CONTAINER_ROOT`, `LEAPP_DEVEL_SKIP_CHECK_OS_RELEASE`,
`LEAPP_DEVEL_SKIP_RHSM` (**deprecated**), `LEAPP_DEVEL_USE_PERSISTENT_PACKAGE_CACHE`,
`LEAPP_NO_RHSM` (via `rhsm.skip_rhsm`), `LEAPP_NOGPGCHECK`, target/product-type
devel overrides.

